    "title": "Odds Are, Dad Is Wrong — Story Hook",
    "summary": "Family game night! Ladders and Lizards. I need a six to win. And I haven't rolled a six all night. Twelve rolls! So I am DUE a six.",
    "startSec": 0.0,
